@host = http://localhost:8080
@access_token_owner = <owner>
@access_token_member = <member>
@room_id = <room id>
@channel_id = <получи из шага «create text channel»>

### Owner создаёт text channel → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general",
  "kind": "text"
}

# Status 201
# Body: {"id":"...","roomId":"...","name":"general","kind":"text","createdAt":"..."}
# Подставь id в @channel_id.

### Owner создаёт voice channel → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "voice-room",
  "kind": "voice"
}

# Status 201

### Member пытается создать → 403 CHANNEL-007
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "off-topic",
  "kind": "text"
}

# Status 403
# Body: {"error":{"code":"CHANNEL-007","message":"insufficient role: admin or owner required"}}

### Неподдерживаемый kind → 400 CHANNEL-002
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "video-call",
  "kind": "video"
}

# Status 400
# Body: {"error":{"code":"CHANNEL-002","message":"invalid channel kind"}}

### Дубликат имени → 409 CHANNEL-004
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general",
  "kind": "text"
}

# Status 409
# Body: {"error":{"code":"CHANNEL-004","message":"channel name already taken"}}

### GET список каналов (member тоже видит) → 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_member}}

# Status 200
# Body: {"items":[{...},{...}]}

### Owner удаляет канал → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels/{{channel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}

# Status 204, без тела

### Member пытается удалить → 403 CHANNEL-007
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels/{{channel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_member}}

# Status 403, CHANNEL-007
